#. Tag: title
#: hayes.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Hayes Modem Command Set"
msgstr "Hayes Modem Command Set"

#. Tag: para
#: hayes.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here is a description of the Hayes Command Set. Most modems follow this "
"command set to large extent. If you lost your modem manual or never had one "
"in the first place, this reference might come in handy. I for instance "
"finally found out how to turn my modems speaker off: <command>ATM0</command> "
"-- Finally: Silence!"
msgstr ""
"Ovdje je opis Hayes Command Set. Mnogi modemi prate ovaj set komandi u "
"velikom opsegu. Ukoliko izgubite priručnik modema ili ga nikad niste ni "
"imali, ova referenca bi mogla biti korisna. Ja sam naprimjer konačno saznao "
"kako ugasiti zvučnik modema: <command>ATM0</command> -- Konačno: Tišina!"

#. Tag: para
#: hayes.docbook:10
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The modem initialization string consists of a series of commands. It "
"prepares the modem for communications, setting such features as dialing "
"mode, waits, detection of the busy signal and many other settings. Newer "
"modem communications programs reset the initializations string for you "
"according to which menu options you select, which features you enable, &etc;"
msgstr ""
"Inicijalni string modema se sastoji od serije komandi. On priprema modem za "
"komunikaciju, postavljajući neke osobine kao što je mod pozivanja, čekanja, "
"detekcije zauzetog signala i mnoge druge stvari. Noviji komunikacijski "
"programi modema ponovno postavljaju inicijalni string za Vas prema opcijama "
"koje ste Vi odabrali, prema osobinama koje ste Vi omogućili, &etc;"

#. Tag: para
#: hayes.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For many years Hayes modems have been the standard. As the field of modem "
"manufactures has grown, most have adhered at least loosely to the Hayes "
"standard. The following is a partial list of the Hayes command set. (called "
"the <quote>AT</quote> commands). The Hayes Command Set can be divided into "
"four groups:"
msgstr ""
"Mnogo godina su Hayes modemi bili standard. Kako se polje proizvodnje modema "
"širilo, mnogi su u najmanju ruku slijedili Hayes standard. Slijedi "
"djelimična lista skupa Hayes naredbi (zvana <quote>AT</quote> komande). "
"Hayes skup naredbi može biti podijeljen u četiri grupe:"

#. Tag: term
#: hayes.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "Basic Command Set"
msgstr "Basic Command Set"

#. Tag: para
#: hayes.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A capital character followed by a digit. For example, <command>M1</command>."
msgstr "Glavni znak praćen cifrom. Na primjer, <command>M1</command>."

#. Tag: term
#: hayes.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Extended Command Set"
msgstr "Extended Command Set"

#. Tag: para
#: hayes.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An <quote>&amp;</quote> (ampersand) and a capital character followed by a "
"digit. This is an extension of the basic command set. For example, "
"<command>&amp;M1</command>. Note that <command>M1</command> is different "
"from <command>&amp;M1</command>."
msgstr ""
"<quote>&amp;</quote> (ampersand) i glavni znak praćen cifrom. . Na primjer, "
"<command>&amp;M1</command>. Primijetite da se <command>M1</command> "
"razlikuje od <command>&amp;M1</command>."

#. Tag: term
#: hayes.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Proprietary Command Set"
msgstr "Proprietary Command Set"

#. Tag: para
#: hayes.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Usually started by either a backslash (<quote>\\</quote>), or a percent sign "
"(<quote>&percnt;</quote>), these commands vary widely among modem "
"manufacturers. For that reason, only a few of these commands are listed "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Obično počinje ili sa obrnutom kosom crtom (<quote>\\</quote>), ili sa "
"znakom procenta (<quote>&percnt;</quote>), ove komande jako variraju među "
"proizvodnjama modema. Iz tog razloga, samo neke od ovih komandi su izlistane "
"ispod."

#. Tag: term
#: hayes.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "Register Commands"
msgstr "Register Commands"

#. Tag: para
#: hayes.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>S<replaceable>r</replaceable>=<replaceable>n</replaceable></"
"command> where <replaceable>r</replaceable> is the number of the register to "
"be changed, and <replaceable>n</replaceable> is the new value that is "
"assigned."
msgstr ""
"<command>S<replaceable>r</replaceable>=<replaceable>n</replaceable></"
"command> gdje je <replaceable>r</replaceable> broj registra koji se mijenja, "
"i <replaceable>n</replaceable> je nova propisana vrijednost."

#. Tag: para
#: hayes.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <quote>register</quote> is computerese for a specific physical location in "
"memory. Modems have small amounts of memory onboard. This fourth set of "
"commands is used to enter values in a particular register (memory location). "
"The register will be storing a particular <quote>variable</quote> (alpha-"
"numeric information) which is utilized by the modem and communication "
"software. For example, <command>S7=60</command> instructs your computer to "
"<quote>Set register #7 to the value 60</quote>."
msgstr ""
"<quote>Register</quote> je informatički naziv za određenu fizičku lokaciju u "
"memoriji. Modemi imaju malu količinu memorije na sebi. Ovaj četvrti set "
"komandi se koristi da se unese vrijednosti u određeni registar (memorijsku "
"lokaciju). Registar će čuvati  <quote>varijablu</quote> (alfa-numeričku "
"informaciju) koja je korištena od strane modema i komunikacijskog softvera. "
"Na primjer, <command>S7=60</command> daje instrukcije Vašem kompjuteru da "
"<quote>Postavi registar #7 na vrijednost 60</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: hayes.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Although most commands are defined by a letter-number combination "
"(<command>L0</command>, <command>L1</command> &etc;), the use of a zero is "
"optional. In this example, <command>L0</command> is the same as a plain "
"<command>L</command>. Keep this in mind when reading the table below!"
msgstr ""
"Mada su mnoge komande definirane kao slovo-broj kombinacija (<command>L0</"
"command>, <command>L1</command> &etc;), upotreba nule je opcionalna. U ovom "
"primjeru, <command>L0</command> je ista kao obično <command>L</command>. "
"Imajte ovo na umu kada budete čitali tabelu ispod!"

#. Tag: para
#: hayes.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here are some of the most important characters that may appear in the modem "
"initialization string. These characters normally should not be changed."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje su neki od najvažnijih znakova koji se mogu pojaviti u inicijalnom "
"stringu modema. Ovi znakovi inače ne bi trebali biti promijenjeni."

#. Tag: para
#: hayes.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tells the modem that modem commands follow. This must begin each line of "
"commands."
msgstr ""
"Govori modemu da slijede komande modema. Ovim mora početi svaka linija "
"komande."

#. Tag: para
#: hayes.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resets the modem to its default state"
msgstr "Resetuje modem na njegove zadane postavke"

#. Tag: term
#: hayes.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>,</command> (a comma)"
msgstr "<command>,</command> (zarez)"

#. Tag: para
#: hayes.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"makes your software pause for a second. You can use more than one <command>,"
"</command> in a row. For example, <command>,,,,</command> tells the software "
"to pause four seconds. (The duration of the pause is governed by the setting "
"of register <varname>S8</varname>.)"
msgstr ""
"pravi pauzu u vašem softveru na sekundu. Možete koristiti više od jednog "
"<command>,</command> u nizu. Na primjer, <command>,,,,</command> govori "
"softveru da pauzira četiri sekunde. (Dužuinom pauze upravlja postavka "
"registra <varname>S8</varname>.)"

#. Tag: para
#: hayes.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sends the terminating Carriage Return character to the modem. This is a "
"control code that most communication software translates as <quote>Carriage "
"Return</quote>"
msgstr ""

